  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:<br>Future Salad is a pioneering wellness brand offering nutrient-rich drink mixes that deliver the benefits of salad in convenient sachet form. Our signature Detox Drink Mix is specially formulated to support natural digestive cleansing and regular bowel movements.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description:<br>A revolutionary drink mix that transforms water into a gut-healthy, fiber-rich beverage. Each sachet contains carefully selected ingredients including leafy greens, vegetables, and natural fiber sources. Designed to help alleviate constipation and support your body's natural detox processes without harsh ingredients.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Primary: Natural, gentle constipation relief and digestive cleansing without laxatives or probiotics</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Secondary: Get your daily greens and fiber in seconds - just shake and drink. No prep, no waste, no hassle. Perfect for busy lifestyles while supporting optimal gut health.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Available in 7-pack and 30-pack options</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Free from laxatives, probiotics, and artificial preservatives</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Easy to store and transport</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Long shelf life at room temperature</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Most users report results within 24-48 hours</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Gentle enough for daily use</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Natural cleansing through fiber-rich ingredients</li>\r\n</ul>",
